Hey there! We have made it to the README file together!

In the project folder, you will find the various codes which will ultimately allow you to input information as the user.

In the RESTful API, I incorporated base code from Spring Boot with Java so you can interact with the chatbot I created.

To run this application, simply follow the prompts when running the code. If there is an error, don't worry! The code will work around it!

Unfortunately, I did not use any axternam APIs simply because the RESTful API was sufficient.
